<Legal title="Explicit Consent" description="Personal data processing Harcama Atlası carries out only with your consent: website visit statistics and marketing messages.">
  <p>
    Processing needed to run the Service does not depend on your explicit consent; it is described in the <a href="/en/legal/kvkk">KVKK Privacy Notice</a>. The processing
    below happens only if you consent. Not consenting does not affect your use of the Service, and you can withdraw your consent at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Website visit statistics</h2>
  <p>
    If you choose “Accept” in the cookie box at the bottom of the site, the pages you visit, the link you came from, your device and browser type and your approximate location
    (country, city) are processed on PostHog Inc.’s servers in the European Union (Germany) to understand and improve how the site is used. This is a transfer abroad under
    KVKK Art. 9. You can withdraw consent by choosing “Reject” via the “Cookie preferences” link at the bottom of the page.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Promotional and information messages</h2>
  <p>
    If you separately tick the box during sign-up or the Financial Map test, messages about new features, campaigns and financial content may be sent to your email address.
    Your consent for commercial electronic messages is recorded in the Message Management System (İYS). You can opt out via the link in any message or by writing to
    <Fill k="eposta" label="E-posta" />. No such messages are currently sent.
  </p>

  <h2>Declaration of consent</h2>
  <p>
    By ticking the relevant box or choosing “Accept”, I declare that I have read and understood this text and the <a href="/en/legal/kvkk">KVKK Privacy Notice</a>, and that I
    freely consent to the processing of my personal data described above, for the stated purposes and by transfer to the stated recipients.
  </p>

  <p>Data controller: <Fill k="unvan" label="Şirket unvanı" />, <Fill k="adres" label="Açık adres" />.</p>
</Legal>
